  "description": "Syncfusion® ASP.NET Core Query Builder control provides an intuitive rule-based UI for building complex filter queries without writing code. It supports multiple condition groups, various operators (equals, contains, between, in, etc.), data type-specific editors, import/export of rules in SQL and JSON formats, and custom templates for rule editors. It is ideal for building advanced search, filter panels, and report query interfaces in data-intensive ASP.NET Core applications.",
